<title>BELGIUM: BBL reiterates PetroFina buy rating.</title>
<headline>BBL reiterates PetroFina buy rating.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name--------Sector-------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>PetroFina  Oil,chemicals  11,900*  BBL/Vermeulen-Raemdonck</p>
<p>COMMENT: Refining and marketing is leaving doldrums after six disastrous years for industry, helped by capacity closures. Oil and gas production volumes set to rise to 275/300,000 barrels a day by 2000 from 233,000 barrels a day in 1996. Petrochemicals will be hit by downturn in 1998-1999, but PetroFina building up excellent position for longer term. Twelve month target price for share 13,500 francs</p>
<p>Recommendation: BUY  Analyst: Francois Poullet</p>
<p>(*) Date of research report: 10/02/1997</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Net dividend</p>
<p> 1995	   528 BFR    n/a	 n/a     264 BFR</p>
<p> 1996	   688 BFR    n/a	 17.2    290 BFR</p>
<p> 1997	   751 BFR    n/a	 15.8    320 BFR</p>
<p> 1998	   749 BFR    n/a	 15.8    350 BFR</p>
